   8:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_cryp_des.c ****   *          input message using DES in ECB/CBC modes.
   9:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_cryp_des.c ****   *          It uses the stm32f4xx_cryp.c/.h drivers to access the STM32F4xx CRYP
  10:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_cryp_des.c ****   *          peripheral.
