  18:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_cryp_des.c ****    (#) Enable The CRYP controller clock using 
  19:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_cryp_des.c ****        RCC_AHB2PeriphClockCmd(RCC_AHB2Periph_CRYP, ENABLE); function.
